TIP:  For the intro and outro there’s a |D| - Em - EmG voicing that’s just a bit tricky because it’s so quick.  Begin with a single strum of |D|, then play the (Em) with your index and middle finger, adding your pinky to the 1st string/3rd fret for the EmG.  Release for the next (Em) and back on again for the 2nd EmG.  Then another single strum of |D| to the (G) to end the sequence.

TIP:  If you don't like the (Bm) you can play an (Em) or play the (G) straight through to the (C).
 

